{"1959840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Rewind Factory", "steam_appid": 1959840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "You have one task: complete a software update for a company. But just as it's about to complete, everything goes wrong and you end up in a test track. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959840/extras/78655ecde1975f83f84908f04ecd92fb.poster.avif?t=1745519418\" width=600 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959840/extras/78655ecde1975f83f84908f04ecd92fb.webm?t=1745519418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959840/extras/78655ecde1975f83f84908f04ecd92fb.mp4?t=1745519418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The only way out is by completing the test track. Luckily, you have gained the ability to rewind trough time and some others like wall running, dashing and sliding.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959840/extras/33282fe2835b9a718614a0f97142e97d.poster.avif?t=1745519418\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959840/extras/33282fe2835b9a718614a0f97142e97d.webm?t=1745519418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959840/extras/33282fe2835b9a718614a0f97142e97d.mp4?t=1745519418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Fight your way trough the test chambers as fast as possible to get back to the computer, while also encountering problems regarding the facility, due to the instability of the facility's software.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Features</u></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Singleplayer / storymode</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959840/extras/3759455be2a12ef7b0ebe4ec2e9f03bd.poster.avif?t=1745519418\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959840/extras/3759455be2a12ef7b0ebe4ec2e9f03bd.webm?t=1745519418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959840/extras/3759455be2a12ef7b0ebe4ec2e9f03bd.mp4?t=1745519418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Fight through 35 test chambers!<br></li><li> <strong>Endless mode</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959840/extras/7239e1acd3bc1ff8be3a2a2caab3a557.poster.avif?t=1745519418\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959840/extras/7239e1acd3bc1ff8be3a2a2caab3a557.webm?t=1745519418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959840/extras/7239e1acd3bc1ff8be3a2a2caab3a557.mp4?t=1745519418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Play a randomly generated test chamber!<br></li><li> <strong>Level Editor</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959840/extras/8d637c42ee3c83945b43ca8808a2cee4.poster.avif?t=1745519418\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959840/extras/8d637c42ee3c83945b43ca8808a2cee4.webm?t=1745519418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959840/extras/8d637c42ee3c83945b43ca8808a2cee4.mp4?t=1745519418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Make your own test chambers, or what ever you like: droppers, mini games. The possiblities are endless!<br></li><li> <strong>Workshop integration</strong><br>Download custom maps made by others, or upload your own custom maps!<br></li><li> <strong>Leaderboards</strong><br>Compete against other players for the best time in a test chamber!</li></ul></h2><br><br><br><strong>Controller Support:</strong><br>The game has full controller support, except for the in-game level editor, which is why it is flagged as Partial Controller Support.", "about_the_game": "You have one task: complete a software update for a company. But just as it's about to complete, everything goes wrong and you end up in a test track. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959840/extras/78655ecde1975f83f84908f04ecd92fb.poster.avif?t=1745519418\" width=600 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959840/extras/78655ecde1975f83f84908f04ecd92fb.webm?t=1745519418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959840/extras/78655ecde1975f83f84908f04ecd92fb.mp4?t=1745519418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The only way out is by completing the test track. Luckily, you have gained the ability to rewind trough time and some others like wall running, dashing and sliding.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959840/extras/33282fe2835b9a718614a0f97142e97d.poster.avif?t=1745519418\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959840/extras/33282fe2835b9a718614a0f97142e97d.webm?t=1745519418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959840/extras/33282fe2835b9a718614a0f97142e97d.mp4?t=1745519418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Fight your way trough the test chambers as fast as possible to get back to the computer, while also encountering problems regarding the facility, due to the instability of the facility's software.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Features</u></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Singleplayer / storymode</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959840/extras/3759455be2a12ef7b0ebe4ec2e9f03bd.poster.avif?t=1745519418\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959840/extras/3759455be2a12ef7b0ebe4ec2e9f03bd.webm?t=1745519418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959840/extras/3759455be2a12ef7b0ebe4ec2e9f03bd.mp4?t=1745519418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Fight through 35 test chambers!<br></li><li> <strong>Endless mode</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959840/extras/7239e1acd3bc1ff8be3a2a2caab3a557.poster.avif?t=1745519418\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959840/extras/7239e1acd3bc1ff8be3a2a2caab3a557.webm?t=1745519418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959840/extras/7239e1acd3bc1ff8be3a2a2caab3a557.mp4?t=1745519418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Play a randomly generated test chamber!<br></li><li> <strong>Level Editor</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959840/extras/8d637c42ee3c83945b43ca8808a2cee4.poster.avif?t=1745519418\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959840/extras/8d637c42ee3c83945b43ca8808a2cee4.webm?t=1745519418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959840/extras/8d637c42ee3c83945b43ca8808a2cee4.mp4?t=1745519418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Make your own test chambers, or what ever you like: droppers, mini games. The possiblities are endless!<br></li><li> <strong>Workshop integration</strong><br>Download custom maps made by others, or upload your own custom maps!<br></li><li> <strong>Leaderboards</strong><br>Compete against other players for the best time in a test chamber!</li></ul></h2><br><br><br><strong>Controller Support:</strong><br>The game has full controller support, except for the in-game level editor, which is why it is flagged as Partial Controller Support.", "short_description": "A software update fails and you end up in a test track. The only way out: complete the test track. You can rewind through time, wall run, dash, slide and slow down time to complete the test chambers as fast a possible. Can you beat the fastest time in this FPS movement based game?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959840/header.jpg?t=1745519418", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959840/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745519418", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959840/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745519418", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum: